            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n\n管家的看法:\n%@"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "\n⚠️ 裡面有 %lld 個沒 commit 的改動。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n⚠️ There are %lld uncommitted changes inside."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n⚠️ 裡面有 %lld 個沒 commit 的改動。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "\n「只提交這個資料夾」會先把其他資料夾的檔案取消暫存(改動還在)。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nCommit only this folder first unstages files from other folders (their changes are kept)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n「只提交這個資料夾」會先把其他資料夾的檔案取消暫存(改動還在)。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "\n出處:%@\n內容:\n%@": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "\n出處:%1$@\n內容:\n%2$@"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nSource: %@\nContent:\n%@"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "\n注意:這個檔案正在 Office 編輯中,還原後請在 Office 重新打開,否則 Office 存檔時會蓋掉還原的內容。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\nNote: This file is being edited in Office. Reopen it in Office after restoring, or saving in Office will overwrite the restored content."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "\n注意:這個檔案正在 Office 編輯中,還原後請在 Office 重新打開,否則 Office 存檔時會蓋掉還原的內容。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "\n要做的事:%@": {
