    "「%@」在你開始改之後被別人改過了,先在分頁裡決定要覆蓋還是載入新版。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "'%@' was changed by someone else after you started editing. Choose whether to overwrite it or load the latest version in its tab first."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "「%@」在你開始改之後被別人改過了,先在分頁裡決定要覆蓋還是載入新版。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
