    "在這台電腦登入的話,完成後會自動接上。用手機或別台電腦時,登入後的頁面會打不開(網址開頭是 http://127.0.0.1 或 http://localhost),把那一頁的整段網址貼到這裡:": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "If you log in on this computer, setup will finish automatically. On a phone or another computer, the page after login will not open (its URL starts with http://127.0.0.1 or http://localhost). Paste the entire URL here:"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "在這台電腦登入的話,完成後會自動接上。用手機或別台電腦時,登入後的頁面會打不開(網址開頭是 http://127.0.0.1 或 http://localhost),把那一頁的整段網址貼到這裡:"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
