    "外掛需要的軟體會下載到 ~/.agent-steward/tools,不需要管理員權限。關閉只是把功能藏起來,下載的東西會保留;「移除下載的檔案」只刪專案管家自己下載的,不會動你自己裝的軟體。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Plugin software is downloaded to ~/.agent-steward/tools without administrator privileges. Turning a feature off keeps its downloads. Remove downloaded files only deletes files downloaded by Agent Steward, not software you installed yourself."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "外掛需要的軟體會下載到 ~/.agent-steward/tools,不需要管理員權限。關閉只是把功能藏起來,下載的東西會保留;「移除下載的檔案」只刪專案管家自己下載的,不會動你自己裝的軟體。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
