    "從 %@ 更新到 %@。\n會從 GitHub 下載 %@ 的安裝程式和專案管家程式(含相依套件),再依新版的設定更新 herdr、herdr 外掛和你已經接上的 agent。\n更新時背景服務會重新啟動,開著的網頁終端機會斷線一次。": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "new",
            "value": "從 %1$@ 更新到 %2$@。\n會從 GitHub 下載 %3$@ 的安裝程式和專案管家程式(含相依套件),再依新版的設定更新 herdr、herdr 外掛和你已經接上的 agent。\n更新時背景服務會重新啟動,開著的網頁終端機會斷線一次。"
          }
        },
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Update from %@ to %@.\nThe installer and Agent Steward %@ (including dependencies) will be downloaded from GitHub. The new installer will update herdr, its plugins, and connected agents according to the new version's settings.\nBackground services will restart, and open web terminals will disconnect once."
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "從 herdr 目前的 agent 開一條支線;長按有其他開法": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Start a side branch from the current herdr agent; hold for other options"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從 herdr 目前的 agent 開一條支線;長按有其他開法"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "從「檔案」上傳…": {
