    "從任何地方經 Tailscale 連進來,有 https 網址(手機複製貼上才能用)。下面這些帳號的個人裝置(手機、筆電)免密碼;其他人要用管理密碼登入。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Connect from anywhere with Tailscale using an HTTPS URL (needed for copy and paste on phones). Personal devices of the accounts below skip the password; others must use the admin password."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從任何地方經 Tailscale 連進來,有 https 網址(手機複製貼上才能用)。下面這些帳號的個人裝置(手機、筆電)免密碼;其他人要用管理密碼登入。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "從別的裝置、瀏覽器登入時要輸入這組密碼(Tailscale 本人的裝置免密碼)。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Enter this password when logging in from another device or browser (your own Tailscale devices do not need it)."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從別的裝置、瀏覽器登入時要輸入這組密碼(Tailscale 本人的裝置免密碼)。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "從已整理掉的舊對話找相關內容,自動附在這次的問題裡。只支援本地或自架(OpenAI 相容)接口,例如 Ollama 的 bge-m3;不設定就只用關鍵字搜尋。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Find relevant content in older, summarized conversations and attach it to the current question. Supports only local or self-hosted OpenAI-compatible providers, such as bge-m3 in Ollama. Leave unset to use keyword search only."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "從已整理掉的舊對話找相關內容,自動附在這次的問題裡。只支援本地或自架(OpenAI 相容)接口,例如 Ollama 的 bge-m3;不設定就只用關鍵字搜尋。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "從瀏覽器回來後可以按「重新整理」查看登入狀態。": {
