    "所以不會自動記錄進度、也不會開工作卡。電腦上的 agent CLI(Claude Code、Codex…)只能用在聊天。到設定 → AI 接口登入一個:ChatGPT/Claude/Copilot 訂閱、OpenAI/Gemini/OpenRouter 等 API 金鑰,或本地模型都可以。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Progress will not be recorded and cards will not be created automatically. Agent CLIs on your computer (Claude Code, Codex…) can only be used for chat. In Settings → AI providers, connect a ChatGPT/Claude/Copilot subscription, an OpenAI/Gemini/OpenRouter API key, or a local model."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "所以不會自動記錄進度、也不會開工作卡。電腦上的 agent CLI(Claude Code、Codex…)只能用在聊天。到設定 → AI 接口登入一個:ChatGPT/Claude/Copilot 訂閱、OpenAI/Gemini/OpenRouter 等 API 金鑰,或本地模型都可以。"
