    "提案 → 已核准:派工\n卡住/完成 → 已核准:重新派工(附上次結果)\n進行中/卡住 → 完成:手動標記\n任何 → 提案:退回\n「進行中」只能由派工產生\n\n點卡片看詳情;長按卡片選動作,或拖到別欄。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Proposal → Approved: dispatch\nBlocked/Done → Approved: redispatch with previous results\nIn progress/Blocked → Done: mark manually\nAny → Proposal: return\nOnly dispatch can set In progress\n\nTap a card for details; hold to choose an action, or drag it to another column."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "提案 → 已核准:派工\n卡住/完成 → 已核准:重新派工(附上次結果)\n進行中/卡住 → 完成:手動標記\n任何 → 提案:退回\n「進行中」只能由派工產生\n\n點卡片看詳情;長按卡片選動作,或拖到別欄。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
