    "會在 .gitignore 加上 %@,之後「全部加入」就不會把 worktree 資料夾一起加進去。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Adds %@ to .gitignore so Stage all will not include the worktree folder."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會在 .gitignore 加上 %@,之後「全部加入」就不會把 worktree 資料夾一起加進去。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "會在主資料夾執行 git merge --no-ff %@。有衝突會自動取消,主資料夾不變。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs git merge --no-ff %@ in the main folder. If there are conflicts, the merge is aborted and the main folder stays unchanged."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會在主資料夾執行 git merge --no-ff %@。有衝突會自動取消,主資料夾不變。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "會執行 git rm --cached %@:只從版本控制拿掉,資料夾和檔案都不動。只放進暫存區,還要你自己提交。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Runs git rm --cached %@ to remove it from version control only; folders and files stay untouched. The change is staged and still needs to be committed."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "會執行 git rm --cached %@:只從版本控制拿掉,資料夾和檔案都不動。只放進暫存區,還要你自己提交。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
