    "每次從 Office 存檔前會留下舊版本(最近 20 版、30 天內)。點一下預覽;左滑或長按可以還原,還原時目前的版本也會先留一份。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Keeps the previous version before each save from Office (up to 20 versions, within 30 days). Tap to preview; swipe left or hold to restore. Restoring also keeps a copy of the current version."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "每次從 Office 存檔前會留下舊版本(最近 20 版、30 天內)。點一下預覽;左滑或長按可以還原,還原時目前的版本也會先留一份。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
    "每隔幾分鐘": {
