    "這台電腦上偵測到的 AI agent。「接上專案管家」會修改它的設定檔(先備份成 *.bak-steward-日期),之後開工就能讀到專案進度、問管家、回報;「拿掉」只移除專案管家加的部分。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "AI agents detected on this computer. Connecting backs up their config files as *.bak-steward-date, then adds access to project briefs, steward questions, and reports. Disconnecting only removes what Agent Steward added."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hant": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "這台電腦上偵測到的 AI agent。「接上專案管家」會修改它的設定檔(先備份成 *.bak-steward-日期),之後開工就能讀到專案進度、問管家、回報;「拿掉」只移除專案管家加的部分。"
          }
        }
      },
      "extractionState": "manual"
    },
